Purpose:
Module ka database structure define karta hai. Ye decide karta hai ki MongoDB mein ek module ke andar kaun-kaun se fields honge aur unki validation kya hogi.

Schema Fields:

title → Module ka naam. String, required.
description → Module ka description. String, required.
order → Module ka sequence/order. Number, required aur unique.
difficulty → Module ka difficulty level. Beginner, Intermediate, ya Advanced.
estimatedTime → Module complete karne ka estimated time, minutes mein. Number, required.
isPublished → Module users ko visible hai ya nahi. Boolean, default true.
timestamps → Automatically createdAt aur updatedAt fields create karta hai.

Export:
Module Mongoose model export hota hai, jise controllers database operations ke liye use karte hain.